OL,3,AMexican drug lord Miguel Angel Felix
OL,4,AGallardo dies age 80
OL,5,
OL,6,FNotorious Mexican drug lord Miguel
OL,7,FAngel Felix Gallardo has died in
OL,8,Fhospital aged 80.
OL,10,FFelix Gallardo was widely considered
OL,11,Fone of the biggest drug smugglers in
OL,12,Fhistory and is credited with building
OL,13,Fan alliance between criminal groups in
OL,14,FColombia and his own Mexican cartel.
OL,16,FKnown as The Godfather or the 'Boss of
OL,17,FBosses', Felix Gallardo was the head of
OL,18,Fthe all-powerful Guadalajara Cartel,
OL,19,Fwhich reigned over Mexican drug
OL,20,Ftrafficking at the height of the
OL,21,Fcocaine boom of the 1980s.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
